# Database backups — NEVER commit these. This repository is public, so a dump
# pushed here publishes every row in it, permanently: git history, forks and
# GitHub's caches all keep a copy long after the file is deleted.
# Backups belong in Render's own backup storage or your IT team's secure store.
*.dump
*.sql.gz
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.bak
*.pgdump
**/pg_dump*/
